WEBVTT

00:01:44.420 --> 00:01:47.980
Still, it's risky to move in this sandstorm...

00:01:47.980 --> 00:01:53.960
There is a chance that we might run into Sleeper Zoids from the Republic... I mean, the rebels.

00:01:54.390 --> 00:01:57.620
There's no need to worry about that, Major Marx.

00:01:57.620 --> 00:02:01.380
The advance force has already taken care of it.

00:02:01.380 --> 00:02:04.810
There will be no one to hinder your advancement into the Cronos Fortress.

00:02:04.810 --> 00:02:09.820
It can't be... I didn't know about any advance force.

00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:13.980
W-Wait, do you mean the Saber Tiger pilot...?

00:02:14.330 --> 00:02:15.990
It's too bad for you.

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:18.360
If you were able to take the Cronos Fortress down alone,

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:20.240
you might have been promoted to Lieutenant Colonel.

00:02:20.920 --> 00:02:24.530
Oh well. Since Schwarz's troops are on their way, you will just have to share the glory with them.

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:26.640
Wait, Lord Proitzen.

00:02:28.050 --> 00:02:30.790
My troop will depart immediately!

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:38.130
I will definitely outdo Schwarz and become a Lieutenant Colonel.

00:02:40.110 --> 00:02:42.640
We're leaving immediately! Get ready!

00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:10.360
<b>DATS & Zoids-Anime Present</b>

00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:10.360
<b>The Black Organoid</b>

00:03:23.100 --> 00:03:25.490
My stomach is growling...

00:03:25.490 --> 00:03:30.150
When we get there, I'm going to eat chilled papaya till I'm full.

00:03:31.300 --> 00:03:32.770
Van is always thinking of food.

00:03:33.140 --> 00:03:34.150
What...?

00:03:36.370 --> 00:03:38.060
By the way, it's hot.

00:03:38.060 --> 00:03:40.660
Moonbay, open the hatch and let in some air.

00:03:41.130 --> 00:03:45.620
Don't be silly. It's over 100 degrees outside.

00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:50.080
If you open the hatch, 100 degree-air will be blowing in.

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:53.000
Guess I still have a lot to learn.

00:03:57.880 --> 00:04:00.920
What's that? Looks like a graveyard of Zoids.

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:02.420
Poor things.

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:05.230
I wonder if there was a big battle here.

00:04:05.230 --> 00:04:07.220
No, I don't think so.

00:04:07.800 --> 00:04:08.490
Why's that?

00:04:08.490 --> 00:04:13.270
Look carefully. There are only Republican Zoids.

00:04:13.830 --> 00:04:18.630
I see... if there were a battle here, there should be Imperial Zoids too.

00:04:18.630 --> 00:04:20.500
Hmm...

00:04:22.810 --> 00:04:24.240
So what happened?

00:04:36.190 --> 00:04:39.390
What's going on, Moonbay? Let's go to the village and get some rest.

00:04:40.360 --> 00:04:41.880
See that?

00:04:47.580 --> 00:04:48.890
What are they doing?

00:04:48.890 --> 00:04:50.460
Playing with sand?

00:04:50.460 --> 00:04:53.400
No. They're digging trenches to prepare for war.

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:19.040
That should be good.

00:05:20.560 --> 00:05:22.130
Thank you, Moonbay.

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:25.580
Why the serious faces... what's up?

00:05:26.200 --> 00:05:28.040
I was talking with Irvine.

00:05:28.770 --> 00:05:32.280
We think we'd better not stop at this village.

00:05:32.280 --> 00:05:33.310
Why?

00:05:34.030 --> 00:05:38.040
You said it yourself. They're preparing for war.

00:05:38.710 --> 00:05:42.690
Looks like it'll be starting soon... and continue as a big battle.

00:05:42.690 --> 00:05:47.020
So we should just stock up on supplies before we're caught up in their affairs.

00:05:49.920 --> 00:05:52.250
Hey, hey, looks like we're already caught up in their affairs.

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:55.600
No way. We haven't done anythin-

00:05:56.830 --> 00:05:58.180
Looks like it...

00:05:58.180 --> 00:06:02.160
What's wrong, guys? Have we've done something?

00:06:03.150 --> 00:06:05.130
Are you the owner of this Zoid?

00:06:05.910 --> 00:06:07.580
Yeah. It's my partner.

00:06:08.950 --> 00:06:10.680
Hey. Are you his companions?

00:06:11.110 --> 00:06:13.840
Looks like the outcome will be the same, whatever the answer.

00:06:14.210 --> 00:06:16.470
At times like this...

00:06:25.330 --> 00:06:26.660
All right. Arrest them.

00:06:26.660 --> 00:06:27.110
Sir!

00:06:28.220 --> 00:06:29.980
O-Ouch. What are you doing?

00:06:29.980 --> 00:06:31.160
Be quiet!

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:32.780
No! Van!

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:36.330
Are you okay, Fiine?

00:06:36.860 --> 00:06:38.210
You brat...

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:43.740
Thank you, Sieg!

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:46.840
Get those guys!

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:50.560
Stop it.

00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:53.350
Stop it!

00:06:56.460 --> 00:06:58.600
Stop, Sieg.

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:03.420
Why did you stop him?

00:07:05.730 --> 00:07:06.480
Van, run!

00:07:06.890 --> 00:07:08.440
Defiance?!

00:07:08.950 --> 00:07:09.840
Irvine!

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:10.860
Now, run!

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:11.970
Okay.

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:14.030
After them!

00:07:14.690 --> 00:07:17.990
Stop! Hold it right there!

00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:40.820
Okay. You and you, that way!

00:07:40.810 --> 00:07:41.270
Yes, sir!

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:43.130
And you, check over there!

00:07:43.130 --> 00:07:43.650
Yes, sir!

00:07:47.660 --> 00:07:48.560
This way!

00:07:55.230 --> 00:07:56.580
What rotten luck.

00:07:57.090 --> 00:08:00.650
Just when I thought I would get to wash my hair.

00:08:01.650 --> 00:08:03.540
Geez, women sure are...

00:08:04.410 --> 00:08:07.840
More importantly, they're going to come and rescue us, right?

00:08:08.330 --> 00:08:12.680
Relax. You should know better than to ask.

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:16.490
Where did they go?

00:08:16.490 --> 00:08:17.350
Search there when you are done with that.

00:08:17.350 --> 00:08:17.860
Yes, sir.

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:18.920
Are they there?

00:08:18.920 --> 00:08:20.450
They're not here!

00:08:20.450 --> 00:08:22.720
Where the hell did they go?

00:08:26.870 --> 00:08:28.510
Van, it tickles.

00:08:28.510 --> 00:08:30.480
Shh... put up with it.

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:32.950
Hey! What are you doing there?!

00:08:32.950 --> 00:08:34.290
Shoot, they found us!

00:08:34.930 --> 00:08:38.530
Judging by your clothing, you are not from this village, are you?

00:08:41.020 --> 00:08:42.540
What happened?

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:55.350
Don't tell me that you took them all out? Awesome.

00:08:58.240 --> 00:08:59.770
You saved us, thanks...

00:09:01.050 --> 00:09:03.710
What's with him? He's not very friendly.

00:09:03.710 --> 00:09:04.600
There they are!

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:05.230
Not good!

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:13.900
What are you doing?

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:16.460
Run, faster!

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:20.240
I don't care how strong you are, you can't possibly win against that many.

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:23.850
What should we do?

00:09:23.850 --> 00:09:25.510
Whatever we do, we must leave this village.

00:09:30.320 --> 00:09:32.050
This must be their doing.

00:09:33.610 --> 00:09:34.840
Hey, are you okay?

00:09:37.030 --> 00:09:38.810
A b-black Zoid...

00:09:39.200 --> 00:09:40.050
A what?

00:09:46.300 --> 00:09:48.440
You've been summoned to the Commander's office.

00:09:49.030 --> 00:09:51.290
I wonder which way the wind is blowing.

00:09:52.500 --> 00:09:56.040
Irvine, do you know somebody in the Republican Forces?

00:09:56.040 --> 00:09:56.790
Nope.

00:09:57.800 --> 00:09:59.450
Anyway, let's listen to what they have to say first.

00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:01.240
I'm already sick of this cell's bed.

00:10:03.420 --> 00:10:04.920
Please forgive me for the misunderstanding.

00:10:04.920 --> 00:10:07.130
I am Lieutenant Colonel Ford, second-in-command of this unit.

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:09.330
Does this mean that the
 misunderstanding has been cleared up?

00:10:09.660 --> 00:10:14.500
Why did you have to put us through such trouble?

00:10:14.500 --> 00:10:15.630
Can you please explain?

00:10:18.480 --> 00:10:19.640
It started two days ago.

00:10:20.780 --> 00:10:24.080
A medium-sized troop of frontline Sleepers that protect this fort...

00:10:24.080 --> 00:10:26.100
Were attacked by something, and annihilated.

00:10:26.960 --> 00:10:28.320
A medium-sized troop has...?

00:10:29.430 --> 00:10:30.430
30 Zoids.

00:10:31.220 --> 00:10:34.860
Could it be those Zoids that we saw on the way here?

00:10:35.780 --> 00:10:38.050
It's hard to believe,

00:10:38.050 --> 00:10:40.410
but from the memories of the destroyed Sleepers,

00:10:40.850 --> 00:10:43.360
the attacker was just a single Zoid.

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:49.670
An Organoid, at that, similar to the one you have with you.

00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:51.540
Sieg?

00:10:51.800 --> 00:10:55.550
Another thing similar to Sieg? There are two of them?

00:10:56.010 --> 00:10:58.230
Oh, yes. I will return this to you.

00:10:59.480 --> 00:11:04.020
By the way, I am surprised to find that you know Captain Hermann.

00:11:04.850 --> 00:11:09.470
If you had shown this to us in the first place, you wouldn't have been treated so harshly.

00:11:10.780 --> 00:11:12.710
If I'm not mistaken, you are a Lieutenant Colonel, right?

00:11:12.710 --> 00:11:15.010
You're ranked quite highly in the military.

00:11:15.450 --> 00:11:21.580
Why would you believe us with just a letter of recommendation from a captain?

00:11:21.580 --> 00:11:24.130
You mean you don't know about him? He's...

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:28.470
It's me.

00:11:29.860 --> 00:11:30.710
What?

00:11:31.880 --> 00:11:33.590
Okay. Just tail them.

00:11:34.330 --> 00:11:35.660
Don't lay hands on them.

00:11:36.290 --> 00:11:38.110
I have found out the location of your friends.

00:11:38.390 --> 00:11:39.590
Van and Fiine?

00:11:40.530 --> 00:11:43.130
Looks like they have one other young boy with them.

00:11:43.130 --> 00:11:44.100
Do you have any idea who that is?

00:11:47.150 --> 00:11:50.440
It seems that boy has the black Organoid.

00:12:09.340 --> 00:12:10.330
It's delicious.

00:12:11.050 --> 00:12:12.520
We're saved.

00:12:12.520 --> 00:12:15.800
I thought I would die of thirst with those soldiers chasing us around.

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:19.890
My name is Van, and she is Fiine.

00:12:19.890 --> 00:12:20.510
Nice to meet you.

00:12:21.920 --> 00:12:24.110
I still don't know your name.

00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:24.760
Raven.

00:12:25.330 --> 00:12:28.870
I see... well, nice to meet you, Raven.

00:12:38.660 --> 00:12:40.280
Where are we going?

00:12:40.720 --> 00:12:41.760
Beats me.

00:12:41.760 --> 00:12:43.450
Hey, where are we going?

00:12:43.840 --> 00:12:45.770
I didn't ask you to follow me.

00:12:46.940 --> 00:12:48.490
Don't be like that.

00:12:48.490 --> 00:12:50.660
We're being chased by the Republican Forces, aren't we?

00:12:51.570 --> 00:12:54.640
By the way, what were you doing out there in those fields?

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:57.660
What... still keeping silent?

00:12:59.060 --> 00:13:00.180
What are you going to do?

00:13:01.220 --> 00:13:03.810
What are you going to do about your friends who have been captured?

00:13:03.810 --> 00:13:06.430
I'm going to rescue them, of course.

00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:11.980
Though it'd be tricky for me to sneak in there and save them all by myself...

00:13:12.660 --> 00:13:13.660
I'll help too.

00:13:13.970 --> 00:13:16.080
It would still be difficult, even with your help.

00:13:16.890 --> 00:13:18.900
Now if Sieg was with us, then maybe...

00:13:19.560 --> 00:13:20.710
Sieg?

00:13:20.710 --> 00:13:22.280
My partner.

00:13:22.280 --> 00:13:24.360
He's a Zoid. An Organoid.

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:26.370
You have a Zoid as a partner.

00:13:26.970 --> 00:13:30.240
Is it that weird to have a Zoid as a partner?

00:13:31.460 --> 00:13:33.790
So if this Sieg was here, then what would happen?

00:13:34.480 --> 00:13:36.500
Then it would be easy.

00:13:36.900 --> 00:13:42.210
We would retrieve the Shield Liger, go to the fort, and save them.

00:13:43.130 --> 00:13:46.640
Does that mean you can't do anything without an Organoid's power?

00:13:47.360 --> 00:13:48.650
What's with you?

00:13:48.650 --> 00:13:53.100
First off, you're unfriendly. Then when you finally open your mouth, you're rude.

00:13:57.440 --> 00:13:59.290
Now he's quiet again.

00:14:21.070 --> 00:14:22.490
Prepare for combat, quickly!

00:14:30.850 --> 00:14:33.010
Hey! Aren't you done yet?

00:14:33.010 --> 00:14:34.140
A little bit more!

00:14:34.860 --> 00:14:40.690
You know, if you'd get into the Shield Liger, we wouldn't have to do this.

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:44.600
Really, you never listen to me.

00:14:45.040 --> 00:14:47.620
We shouldn't have let you come here at all.

00:14:49.280 --> 00:14:50.670
I wonder...

00:14:51.520 --> 00:14:55.730
If that kid is the pilot of the Zoid which annihilated the Republican Forces...

00:14:55.730 --> 00:14:58.370
Moonbay! I'm going on ahead!

00:14:58.370 --> 00:15:00.840
Okay. I'll catch up soon.

00:15:01.360 --> 00:15:01.990
See ya.

00:15:10.410 --> 00:15:11.290
Van.

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:34.110
I... can't go any further.

00:15:34.110 --> 00:15:36.200
I think this is a good place to hide.

00:15:36.890 --> 00:15:39.110
They won't follow us this far.

00:15:44.560 --> 00:15:46.340
Huh? Irvine...?

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:48.050
Yup. It's Irvine.

00:15:51.000 --> 00:15:51.920
Irvine!

00:15:51.920 --> 00:15:53.510
We're here! We're here!

00:15:56.730 --> 00:15:59.520
Irvine, you managed to escape! Where's Moonbay?

00:16:07.240 --> 00:16:09.540
Van! Fiine! Get away from that guy!

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:11.040
Irvine...

00:16:13.990 --> 00:16:17.420
He's the one responsible for the Zoid graveyard.

00:16:18.500 --> 00:16:20.210
Raven, you...

00:16:21.120 --> 00:16:23.750
So what?

00:16:25.430 --> 00:16:29.740
Sleepers don't attack for no reason. Why did you do it?

00:16:30.160 --> 00:16:31.630
Because I hate Zoids.

00:16:39.260 --> 00:16:40.040
That's...

00:16:44.940 --> 00:16:45.900
He's there!

00:16:46.430 --> 00:16:49.030
Men, don't let him get away!

00:16:49.850 --> 00:16:54.990
Looks like I'll have to make another Zoid graveyard here.

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:57.090
Why would you do that?

00:16:59.900 --> 00:17:01.460
Shadow!

00:17:05.400 --> 00:17:07.440
Is that... Sieg?

00:17:07.940 --> 00:17:09.630
No...

00:17:15.690 --> 00:17:16.270
Van!

00:17:17.040 --> 00:17:18.050
Damnit...

00:17:23.600 --> 00:17:24.420
Raven!

00:17:29.620 --> 00:17:30.640
Raven...

00:17:34.770 --> 00:17:35.820
Are you all right?

00:17:35.820 --> 00:17:37.910
Van, he's coming!

00:17:47.890 --> 00:17:48.860
Here he comes.

00:17:48.860 --> 00:17:49.630
Commence attack!

00:17:56.750 --> 00:17:57.610
What?

00:17:57.610 --> 00:17:58.180
He's above us?

00:18:31.900 --> 00:18:33.040
Stop that!

00:18:33.040 --> 00:18:34.140
Stop, stop!

00:18:54.530 --> 00:18:55.740
Stop!

00:18:56.290 --> 00:18:58.300
How could he do that?

00:18:58.650 --> 00:19:00.070
I have to do something!

00:19:00.480 --> 00:19:01.200
Van!

00:19:01.610 --> 00:19:02.700
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:19:03.250 --> 00:19:04.130
Moonbay...

00:19:04.140 --> 00:19:05.150
Sieg.

00:19:07.990 --> 00:19:09.540
All right. Sieg!

00:19:36.030 --> 00:19:37.490
What?

00:19:37.980 --> 00:19:41.450
Stop. If you keep fighting in this sadistic way...

00:19:41.950 --> 00:19:43.490
Then what?

00:19:44.220 --> 00:19:45.390
I'll defeat you!

00:19:45.390 --> 00:19:46.460
Defeat me?

00:19:49.940 --> 00:19:54.120
You mean that your Organoid is stronger than mine?

00:19:54.980 --> 00:19:56.310
Why you...

00:20:04.610 --> 00:20:06.170
Now, Sieg!

00:20:17.200 --> 00:20:17.940
What?

00:20:17.940 --> 00:20:19.320
Damn it, where is he?

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:34.910
Damn it.

00:20:48.880 --> 00:20:53.950
Van. Your piloting skills are lousy, and your fighting sucks too.

00:20:53.950 --> 00:20:54.800
What?

00:21:07.710 --> 00:21:09.400
Charge!

00:21:11.530 --> 00:21:12.160
What?

00:21:12.520 --> 00:21:13.620
Damn it.

00:21:16.730 --> 00:21:18.500
Raven, where are you now?

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:19.170
Answer me!

00:21:20.050 --> 00:21:22.630
With the fortified armor of this Gustav... huh?!

00:21:26.820 --> 00:21:27.640
Shadow!

00:21:34.530 --> 00:21:35.400
He ran away.

00:21:36.040 --> 00:21:37.400
No way.

00:21:37.390 --> 00:21:40.360
If he had combined with his Organoid, he could have destroyed us.

00:21:41.150 --> 00:21:44.410
In other words, he let us go?

00:21:44.980 --> 00:21:45.970
Damn it.

00:21:56.430 --> 00:21:58.730
How long are you going to fool around, Raven?

00:21:58.730 --> 00:22:02.000
Rejoin with our troop at once. Do you copy?

00:22:02.000 --> 00:22:03.940
Respond, Raven!

00:22:03.940 --> 00:22:04.750
Raven!

00:22:06.310 --> 00:22:09.510
Playtime's over, huh?

00:23:22.620 --> 00:23:25.130
Preview

00:23:25.330 --> 00:23:26.740
Yo! I'm Van!

00:23:26.740 --> 00:23:30.760
Damn it... next time, I will settle the score with Raven for sure.

00:23:31.810 --> 00:23:36.690
In the mean time, the Imperial Forces are about to attack the Republic's Cronos Fortress.

00:23:37.100 --> 00:23:39.790
But I don't care about that.

00:23:39.790 --> 00:23:41.350
It's a showdown, Saber Tiger!

00:23:42.430 --> 00:23:44.850
Next time, Zoids episode 13!

00:23:44.850 --> 00:23:46.360
The Battle of Cronos!

00:23:47.090 --> 00:23:49.620
Next time, I'll sure be fired up too!

00:23:47.650 --> 00:23:52.590
<b>The Battle of Cronos!</b>
